## 📋 Challenge Overview

The challenge provides a simple input box where user-supplied text is rendered by the server.

The vulnerability is that the application **processes user input as a Jinja2 template instead of treating it as ordinary text**.

This allows us to inject template expressions, execute server-side operations, read files, and ultimately retrieve the flag.

