---

## 🔐 Key Takeaway

> **Never allow untrusted user input to be interpreted as server-side template code.**

Properly separate **data from templates**, apply appropriate validation/escaping, and avoid exposing dangerous objects or functions to template contexts.

**SSTI can escalate from simple template evaluation to server-side code execution and complete application compromise.**
